#. module: account_statement_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_statement_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"Fio refused the request as reaching further back than 90 days without an "
"unlocked history. Unlock it in internet banking (Nastavení → API, the "
"padlock) and retry within ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"Fio požiadavku odmietlo, pretože siaha ďalej než 90 dní dozadu bez "
"odomknutej histórie. Odomknite ju v internet bankingu (Nastavení → API, "
"zámok) a zopakujte pokus do desiatich minút."

#. module: account_statement_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_statement_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"Fio serves movements older than %(days)s days only while the full history is"
" unlocked for this token: open internet banking, go to Nastavení → API and "
"click the padlock on this token. The unlock lasts ten minutes, so do it now "
"and then tick the confirmation box."
msgstr ""
"Pohyby staršie než %(days)s dní Fio vydá len vtedy, ak je pre tento token "
"odomknutá celá história: otvorte internet banking, choďte do Nastavení → API"
" a kliknite pri tomto tokene na zámok. Odomknutie platí desať minút, urobte "
"to teda teraz a potom zaškrtnite potvrdzovacie pole."

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_fio.field_account_bank_statement_line__fio_movement_id
msgid ""
"Fio's ID pohybu — unique per movement, and the key this integration "
"deduplicates on."
msgstr ""
"ID pohybu podľa Fio — jedinečné pre každý pohyb; podľa neho táto integrácia "
"rozpoznáva duplicity."

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_fio.field_account_bank_statement_line__fio_instruction_id
msgid ""
"Fio's ID pokynu. NOT unique: a transfer and its fee share one, and so do a "
"payment and its later reversal — which is why it is never used for duplicate"
" detection. It is also a different number from the batch id returned when a "
"payment order is uploaded, so it cannot link a statement line back to a "
"payment order either."
msgstr ""
"ID pokynu podľa Fio. NIE JE jedinečné: zdieľa ho prevod so svojím poplatkom "
"aj platba so svojím neskorším stornom — preto sa nikdy nepoužíva na "
"rozpoznanie duplicít. Je to aj iné číslo než ID dávky vrátené pri odoslaní "
"platobného príkazu, takže ním nemožno riadok výpisu spojiť späť s platobným "
"príkazom."

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_statement_fio.field_fio_statement_pull__statement_from
msgid "First statement number"
msgstr "Prvé číslo výpisu"

