msgstr "Naimportované transakcie"

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_fio.field_account_journal__fio_overlap_days
msgid ""
"In movements mode, each run re-reads this many days before today. Movements "
"already imported are dropped, so the overlap costs nothing and closes the "
"hole a missed run would leave."
msgstr ""
"V režime pohybov každý beh znova načíta toľko dní dozadu. Už naimportované "
"pohyby sa zahodia, prekryv teda nič nestojí a zaceľuje dieru, ktorú by "
"vynechaný beh nechal."

#. module: account_statement_fio
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_statement_fio/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"Journal %(name)s is set to be fed by the Fio banka API, but it has no Fio "
"read token. Ask an administrator to paste one into the journal's Fio banka "
"section — it is generated in internet banking under Nastavení → API."
msgstr ""
"Denník %(name)s má ako zdroj výpisov nastavené Fio banka API, ale nemá token"
" Fio na čítanie. Požiadajte správcu, aby ho vložil do časti Fio banka na "
"denníku — generuje sa v internet bankingu v Nastavení → API."

